<title>GUATEMALA: GUATEMALA COFFEE EXPORT UPDATE TO AUG 7 - ANACAFE.</title>
<headline>GUATEMALA COFFEE EXPORT UPDATE TO AUG 7 - ANACAFE.</headline>
<dateline>GUATEMALA CITY 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guatemala's National Coffee Association (Anacafe) updated its exports to Aug 7 in the 1996-1997 growing cycle. Volumes are in 100-lb quintal bags.</p>
<p>    Month		  1994-1995     1995-1996     1996-1997</p>
<p>    October		 142,688	 175,826	 174,719</p>
<p>    November		229,443	 327,196	 517,073</p>
<p>    December		390,589	 405,061	 578,028</p>
<p>    January		 417,984	 464,084	 670,786</p>
<p>    February		480,568	 620,974	 877,803</p>
<p>    March		   581,353	 714,116	 753,419</p>
<p>    April		   433,028	 525,010	 749,522</p>
<p>    May		     360,077	 596,912	 529,599</p>
<p>    June		    465,637	 437,818	 335,374</p>
<p>    July		    403,069	 247,400	 168,990</p>
<p>    August		  419,414	 205,647	  *7,830</p>
<p>    September	     328,537	 132,634	   N/A</p>
<p>    TOTAL		 4,652,386     4,852,677    *5,363,142</p>
<p>* Indicates update to Aug 7</p>
<p>    By Type		1994-1995     1995-1996     *1996-1997</p>
<p>    Washed Arabicas   4,243,229     4,325,769     4,923,214</p>
<p>    Stock Lot	     233,234	 361,701	 295,809</p>
<p>    Naturals		162,882	 136,057	 135,119</p>
<p>    Robustas		 13,041	  28,026	   6,000</p>
<p>    Total		 4,652,386     4,851,553     5,360,142</p>
<p>* Indicates update to Aug 3</p>
<p>((--Fiona Ortiz, Guatemala City bureau +502 251-5718))</p>
</text>
